# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Release packaging output (cross-compiled binaries, .xqsp bundles, and the
# generated dev/test-only Ed25519 signing key). None of this is meant to be
# committed — a real release key belongs in secure infra, not the repo.
/dist/

# Local agent tooling: not part of the plugin, developer-machine only.
/.claude/
/.superpowers/
/.repowise/

# Local-only reference material: xQuakShell API docs and working notes.
# Kept on disk for development, deliberately out of the repository.
/architecture.md
/plugin-api.md
/plugin-manifest.md
/security-model.md
/docs/
/API-FINDINGS.md

# Throwaway spike code (phase 0). Never committed.
/spike/
